              "type": "qa",
              "q": "`items.push(x); setItems(items);` and the list never updates. Why?",
              "a_bullets": [
                "Same reference, so `Object.is` says unchanged and React bails out",
                "Pass a new array: `setItems([...items, x])`"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "qa",
              "q": "`Row` is wrapped in `React.memo`, but the parent passes `onSelect={() => pick(id)}`. Does `Row` skip renders?",
              "a_bullets": [
                "No: the inline function is a new reference every render, so the shallow compare fails",
                "Wrap it in `useCallback` so the reference stays stable"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "qa",
              "q": "A text field defined inside another component's body loses focus on every keystroke. Why?",
              "a_bullets": [
